 <li>Khatm jab shaam ke zindaan mai kahani ye huwi, wo jo sunti thi kahani wo sakina na rahi, thame zanjeer naa kahast se utha ek qaidi, ek nanni si lahad kapte haatho se bani, sar shahenshah ka godi me lahu rota tha, wa hussaina ka bas ek shor bapaa hota tha</li>
